r, I can calculate certain probabilities—like if a prior is .9, it might influence the posterior significantly. I’m thinking about conditions for passing certain thresholds and whether errors are more likely to impact rare events instead of overall disposition. There’s definitely uncertainty in this analysis.","format":"openai-responses-v1","index":2},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABq8OIx8e3cJrH8Eu6U0JFhw620k_JAVhEyLAtiQ9D-3UKOp8qoZ3BKRgYTlOS60jfzIjg7MnD3HB3jpOG8VxyTwjuORLD8gJAkmz9qZoscTNV2CN22x7gfDEBbMo-2RA9DsoPemffToCceKYfPK-9WVLZTdraTwKGg5X9n9YQKeO3s2mL5_hk3TWVpo3L6Qm4t2CjvTAScZkJOzKrR3AjlE-Q_M30nrKZLWw3dsFfKAJqql1qXI80SOX-yS3Enn9MOIaAaBJQb3Dunq6Mo4lN_BnNZPvSKAEpZFOqD-E6aBjMG8EKiHz6bNFO79KtPl-pqG6drnYX7nAlIdFFo8z-kMnv1lO0NI1UunRMtpZS6f4nvPdmM9JSGZciiQS6b3Sy14vSaZnWAy7unRqIPgEhgdYmDBOiYlWB7tPqNOv9s3NXyIPHK5cfUlEzz7VkqAabjXkLBvd6yDj7-A2iNfEfP3d3VMtoqyMnhvnl6cm849g28F2QNXj5ab6QGf2HLG-JK8zK2q7bt8opDMPACVmKmSTaWfN0w3cqMbubwiQMHe7Ijxclj6Irkq8kMd-iw4C5Fu_qec6M0SHCfCwRudjDxMcYdaEDcqX_Qd9zm8QRn-K8OgE9WjaGw8LE0rIJQS73_D7s1clQFs7xYG4C4lscDKDRzi4rMGpUYRCRHj-KJ5fj5F21vipNu_CrtM0rapoaZ_T1RtfWxu1NQTKh8TmVNM5w8IguWXeLqlIz5SJ52cCc4jSUMBfCUBiilpJnMRc9D4Byku2cSUf1KVk1N_7fG9YumwNKKWLgBkA46PxYG1vDxb7H07AAtmG4hAAqPoe38L0w8OChyLP6ruOZEIFPkx5Fa3_LdFxnoApwxQkgDSQSQW4xQI76t1H25NP6oSv0_BfHiaG070jbgjO-OxsKhq_rShx5ocIPDtD--HS4xsgzN9JgG4Ro74k8nC23tVUGwRBAno43drRO_KaZLcmuAOgtT61icDDB2KSV57Y43suJw3VVGGcc13UwfBYKh_VoPj2rBL_zPviy1igAY2nL019m2IzVrGUNr8sj0h2IM-OG7NkmX4QHATWpz-buaZv-_4i3Dgn7yFMwVIVldBxN4SWbJr-pXDdEYhmlhvU10ICOBaMcNuXb7hlY4aOI9L-7hOtf87PbiNySNTfBdiRkKKJwWd-T8I8TbFCf56JOhW7kmJip4PZlFitFtkoBmjDBnsRnR1w7JDkYeKcagWuRxNoH1L0Xt68wnIL4y5ERAs2g7rMQ0l0q6ux5ODLJgmoR8dlNUfscwby5XEGwSb4-Dm-84G1Lj2mgr1AatyvjNnJunh6l2zOjH3hRFwUU1CuiBiA9MOUkkcDWGjYV83SBUjJocJl4VSOvVg_LqALVFVUcLhl9po8e63qcOOjUGkKSG_kMWPz_QTAHMwGBnbCz3RFVXQiGv1vr6kmtZKUs03GrHEqfF6dFCOFXm53aLCTKSUhITFWGli7aC-ry8LYv8ZNURz89sJrPW028l_QGdkAgyIt-uRfO_tRKBcXJCUibSrNT2kZZWYJqkInzBd8KP0NX4S8Pjtf9_C3dKbx_lgLqgbH9mLTF6WnXHe-VuV3e9